        },
        {
          "text": " Kobonokis Sadurak, ka Mesak, ka Abed-nego, kotemasi ekabaka atiar, “Wu Nebukadenesar, mam sio ibusakinit aboŋokin jo kotoma akirot kaŋin, ",
          "type": "text",
