            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanen, konyunyurikin eut Nebukadenesar, kitegelikin epone loka akonyeneke mama ejaas Sadurak, ka Mesak, ka Abed-nego, kiner, kicorak aitasaran eupa aatenak akanykaarei adepar nelem esarania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicorak ikagogoŋok ice kanul luajaas ajoreke ajen Sadurak, ka Mesak, ka Abednego: ka acakakin da toma oupa loesarani noi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi koenai ituŋa nul konapitos ipaleikee, ka ikootinikee, ka ilounakec, ka inapenekee ice, kocakakis kidin oupa loesarani nol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuka nun naarai abu ekabaka kicorakinite eut kosaranunite eupa noi, apotu aipelonoreta nuka akim koarata ituŋa kwi luetiŋito Sadurak, ka Mesak, ka Abed-nego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
