              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koboŋok kotema atiar, “Koany, aseseni eoŋ ituŋa iwonon elaeara, elosete kokidin akim, kwabo emamei kes aronis; as ima naka Iokiwononet esubit bala okoku loka idekesio.” ",
          "type": "text",
