          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kikunyak Nebukadenesar okek loka eupa loesarani noi; kotema atiar, “Sadurak, ka Mesak, ka Abed-nego, yes ibulesin luka Edeke Loejai kuju kakui, kolomutu, kopotu nee,” Kosodete Sadurak ka Mesak ka Abed-nego alomun kokidin akim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
