              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Nebukadenesar atiar, “Kituritete Edeke loka Sadurak, ka Mesak, ka Abed-nego, loejukuni ekemalaika, kitaiar ikebulesin luapotu komunokinos ŋes, kilocoto da akirot naka ekabaka, kijaikis awatekec kinyeis aijaanakin karaida aima edeke kere nabarai Edekekee bon. ",
          "type": "text",
